ing scales  after getting chased by the monster for  a bit it manages to flip their humvee  and from what we know before they'll be  fine  despite them getting geeted out of the  truck mid-barrel roll on top of someone  just chilling in the back of the car  so miraculously again nobody gets  injured  and obviously i know that it would be  lame if someone died like this  but still it doesn't make a lot of sense  also while running away i just wanted to  point out this one shot of the main  character completely missing the monster  great job filmmakers also i'll throw  this out now but the editing in this  movie is  cracked it comes from the director of  the resident evil movies  and during action scenes the camera cuts  like crazy  here's an example from later on in the  movie from a fight scene that has  cracked editing  to me it's just a void of logic from an  editing and directing standpoint  to make a movie like this but i guess  that's what you get with a low budget  and lazy filmmakers  so after getting away from the diablo a  little time passes and they run into  some big  spiders the main character gets picked  up and stabbed by the big stinger which  at that size  is basically like getting impaled she  gets knocked out and the rest of her  team runs away  but i'll just stay with her because her  team doesn't last that long  a few minutes later she miraculously  wakes up  which should be impossible if you think  about it  the amount of poison being injected into  her should be a crazy amount  given how massive the spider is and that  they're supposed to be injecting much  bigger creatures  from that alone she should probably be  in a permanent coma  on top of being impaled by the stinger  but she wakes up for whatever reason  just to be impaled again by another  spider  as injected with even more poison it  makes absolutely no sense to include her  waking up here but for some reason they  include it  then surprise surprise she wakes up  again and escapes the 